================================================================================
CHALLENGE 2: THE JOINED TIMEOUT (Coordination)
================================================================================
SCENARIO: Your app fetches a "Daily Quote" from a slow server. If the
server takes longer than 2 seconds, you want to give up and show a
cached quote instead.

1. Create a thread 'FetchQuoteTask'.
2. Inside 'run()', make it sleep for 5 seconds to simulate a slow network.
3. IN MAIN:
   - Start the thread.
   - Use 'thread.join(2000);' // This is the version with a timeout.
   - After the join, check 'if (thread.isAlive())'.
   - If alive, print: "Server too slow! Using cached quote."
   - If not alive, print: "Quote fetched successfully!"
================================================================================